    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textSpeed
      value: 0.05
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0]
      value: Thank you for completing your job on time, Bob.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1]
      value: With this, and everyone elses maps, the strike team should be able to
        push away the mutants swiftly with ease.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2]
      value: I wou- hold on, getting a comms message...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3]
      value: WHAT?! THE MUTANT CREATURES ARE COMING TO THE BUNKER?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4]
      value: Alright, Bob, change of plans, it's all hands on deck, get to the hill
        above the entrance immediately! The mutants are coming this way!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5]
      value: We'll supply you with flaming objects, it's the mutants one weakness!
        Simply push it down the hill to destroy them!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 371959626826342773, guid: df291187225e83849a094bb862b54bbe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[6]
      value: I'll see you out there!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
